'''V-Mart Retail Limited''' is Indian retail company which operates a chain of small-size hypermarkets.<ref>{{Cite news |title=V-Mart Retail Ltd. |work=Business Standard India |url=https://www.business-standard.com/company/v-mart-retail-34162/information/company-history |access-date=2022-10-30}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=V Mart Retail Share Price - V Mart Retail Share Price Live NSE/BSE |url=https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/v-mart-retail-ltd/stocks/companyid-44030.cms |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=The Economic Times |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Roy |first=Debjyoti |date=2022-10-17 |title=V-Mart signs pact to acquire LimeRoad |url=https://www.livemint.com/companies/news/vmart-retail-acquire-tiger-global-backed-limeroad-11666014987266.html |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=mint |language=en}}</ref>  In 2002 Lalit Agarwal<ref>{{Cite web |title=How V-Mart Retail's Lalit Agarwal took work from home to working from 6 locations in India |url=https://www.financialexpress.com/industry/how-v-mart-retails-lalit-agarwal-went-from-working-at-his-centre-table-to-working-from-6-locations-across-india/2213331/ |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=Financialexpress |date=16 March 2021 |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Inflation Could Impact Demand {{!}} Lalit Agarwal, V-Mart |url=https://www.timesnownews.com/videos/et-now/markets/inflation-could-impact-demand-lalit-agarwal-v-mart-video-90534169 |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=TimesNow |date=30 March 2022 |language=en}}</ref> founded this company. Previously it was incorporated as Varin Commercial Private Limited in [[West Bengal]], [[India]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=LimeRoad से उपलब्ध होंगे अनलिमिटेड और V-Mart Retail के सभी प्रोडक्ट्सः ललित अग्रवाल |url=https://hindi.moneycontrol.com/news/company/all-products-of-unlimited-and-v-mart-retail-will-be-available-from-limeroad-lalit-agarwal-837101.html |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=hindi.moneycontrol.com |language=hi}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-10-17 |title=V-Mart set to acquire fashion marketplace LimeRoad; to invest ₹150 crore |url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/v-mart-set-to-acquire-fashion-marketplace-limeroad-to-invest-150-crore/article66021859.ece |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=www.thehindubusinessline.com |language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Rudra |first=Tapanjana |date=2022-10-17 |title=V-Mart To Acquire Fashion Marketplace LimeRoad In A Distress Sale |url=https://inc42.com/buzz/v-mart-retail-to-acquire-fashion-marketplace-limeroad-for-inr-31-12-cr/ |access-date=2022-10-30 |website=Inc42 Media |language=en}}</ref>

